# Commits

- Remote `origin` is `https://github.com/ahmedmsabry2000/grid-pulse.git`. Push is allowed for work tracked through Spec → Issue → Project (`scripts/github/`).
- Prefer Spec/Issue-linked branches (`cursor/<name>-f9a7`) and stage-scoped or issue-scoped commit messages.
- Commit after each stage exit (green tests + stage note) or after finishing Spec acceptance.
- Never force-push; never amend unless explicitly requested and conditions allow.
- Do not push secrets or local caches (`scripts/github/.cache/`).
